OL,3,ADelhi sees more protests as 'cockroach'
OL,4,Agroup's leaders released
OL,5,
OL,6,FA court in Indian capital Delhi has
OL,7,Freleased the top leaders of the Gen
OL,8,FZ-led Cockroach Janta Party (CJP) as
OL,9,Fthe city sees more protests for a
OL,10,Fsecond day with thousands of security
OL,11,Fpersonnel deployed and roads
OL,12,Fbarricaded.
OL,14,FAbhijeet Dipke - who began the movement
OL,15,Fin May after India's Chief Justice
OL,16,Flikened some jobless young people to
OL,17,F"cockroaches" - and other leaders were
OL,18,Farrested on arrival in Delhi on
OL,19,FSaturday to lead protests seeking
OL,20,Felectoral reforms.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
